Archi relationship tables
-------------------------

src/relationships/matrix.generated.ts is generated from relationships.xml in
the Archi repository (https://github.com/archimatetool/archi), directory
com.archimatetool.model. That file is a machine-readable rendering of the
relationship tables in Appendix B.5 of the ArchiMate 3.2 Specification.

